On the way, I see a fruit cart.
There are colorful fruits on the cart.
There are fresh bananas there too.
I go near the cart.
I ask the seller.
"Bhaiya, what is the price of the bananas?"
He says, "The price is thirty rupees."
I say, "I want six bananas."
He gives six bananas to me.
I give him thirty rupees.
He accepts the money.
I safely place the fruits in my bag.
I smile and say thank you.
The seller also smiles.
Now I go back to the office.
